        "genres": "Platform|Adventure",
        "platform_ids": "23",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/sonic-adventure-limited-edition",
        "cached_at": 1772527920
      },
      {
        "id": 45787,
        "name": "Fast Striker 1.5",
        "summary": "2D arcade shooting game with emphasis on scoring originally developed for NEO·GEO. The game lets the player choose between 3 game modes with different scoring systems. Novice Mode for beginners, Original Mode for classic Shoot’ em Up players and Maniac for very experienced players. It features six stages of excellent 2D arcade game play with over 40 unique enemy types, super smooth 3D scrolling backgrounds, huge CGI bosses and it features the biggest megabit count ever since the beginning of NEO·GEO games.\n\nThis is part of a bundle release along with Last Hope: Pink Bullets, and Gunlord in standard Dreamcast type jewel cases",
