      {
        "id": 91184,
        "name": "Romance of the Three Kingdoms VI with Power Up Kit",
        "summary": "\"Romance of the Three Kingdoms Ⅵ with Power Up Kit\" is an expanded version of \"Romance of the Three Kingdoms Ⅵ,\" which was released in 1998 as the 6th game in the series.\n\"Time of the Heavens\" is depicted in dramatic historical events that enliven the world of the Three Kingdoms. \"Advantage of the Land\" gives strategic advantages based on castle location, economic strengths in farming and trade. \"Bonds of People\" allow people to tell their dreams and listen to the opinions of other officers. Use Time, Advantage and Bonds to conquer the continent.",
